# --- compiled, OS/arch-specific binaries + build artifacts (regenerated by `make compile`) ---
# These caused "Exec format error" when an ARM-built binary was committed and
# then run on the x86 measurement host. Never commit build output; recompile
# on the target host instead.
*_run
*.o
*.a
*.so
*.dll
*.exe
# whole-program measurement output (the energy runner APPENDS to these)
*.jsonl

# --- host-calibrated CLBG stdin MEASURE inputs (regenerated by gen-input.sh) ---
# Large, host-specific, NOT committed. The small fasta-1000..10000 inputs used
# for VALIDATION (via cases.txt) stay tracked; only the big measure inputs are
# ignored. Run ./gen-input.sh once per measurement host to (re)create them.
reference/clbg/inputs/fasta-25000000.txt
reference/clbg/inputs/fasta-2500000.txt
reference/clbg/inputs/fasta-500000.txt
*.jar
*.tasty
